{"title":"Full Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFull Artificial Christmas Trees That Make a Holiday Statement\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eOur collection of full artificial Christmas trees features realistic branch tips, natural evergreen shapes, and premium craftsmanship designed to replicate the beauty of real Christmas trees. From wide, extra full Christmas trees that create a grand holiday statement to classic full silhouettes that feel warm and traditional, these trees are perfect for larger living rooms, open spaces, and homes where a fuller tree can become the focal point of the holiday decor. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eMany styles are also available as pre-lit artificial Christmas trees, featuring professionally installed micro LED lights that create a warm and evenly illuminated glow. If you're looking for an extra full Christmas tree with lights, our pre-lit artificial Christmas tree collection makes it easy to find a wide, fully illuminated tree. With a variety of sizes and realistic tree styles available, it’s easy to find the perfect tree to complement your holiday traditions.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\" class=\"h3\"\u003eWhy choose a full artificial Christmas tree?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFull artificial Christmas trees offer a traditional Christmas silhouette most people envision during the holiday season. Their wide silhouette and dense branches provide ample space for \u003ca title=\"Christmas Ornaments\" href=\"/\/collections\/christmas-ornaments\"\u003eornaments\u003c\/a\u003e and \u003ca title=\"Christmas Ribbons\" href=\"/\/collections\/ribbons\"\u003eribbon\u003c\/a\u003e, making them a popular choice for homes with larger rooms and open floor plans. For those who want maximum impact, our extra full and extra wide artificial Christmas trees deliver an especially lush and commanding presence. Carol's Christmas Conifers offers both pre-lit and unlit full artificial Christmas trees to suit your preferred decorating style. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat is the difference between a slim and full Christmas tree? \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFull Christmas trees feature a wider silhouette and fuller branch structure, while \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/slim-artificial-christmas-trees\" title=\"Slim Artificial Christmas Trees\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eslim Christmas trees\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e are designed with a narrower profile for smaller spaces. Full trees are ideal for open rooms and larger living areas, while slim trees work well in apartments, corners, and compact areas.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat size full Christmas tree should I buy?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhen selecting a full artificial Christmas tree, consider both the height of your ceiling and the width of the room. Leaving 6-12 inches between the top of the tree and the ceiling allows space for a tree topper while ensuring the tree fits comfortably in your home. Keep in mind that wider, extra full Christmas trees will also require more floor space, so measuring your room before purchasing is always a good idea. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eIf you still aren’t sure, taking the \u003ca href=\"/\/a\/p\/find-the-perfect-christmas-tree?instore=true#\/\" title=\"Find The Perfect Christmas Tree\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTree Quiz\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e will help you find the perfect size and style for your space!\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat are the best-selling full artificial Christmas trees? \u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhether you’re looking for a classic or \u003ca title=\"Premium Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"/\/collections\/premium-trees\"\u003emost realistic artificial Christmas tree\u003c\/a\u003e, Carol's Christmas Conifers offers best-selling full Christmas tree styles ranging from flocked designs to traditional evergreen silhouettes.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThe \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-tree\" title=\"King Flock Artificial Christmas Trees\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKing Flock\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e is one of our best-selling flocked Christmas trees, featuring a full and densely packed silhouette with branches beautifully flocked to mimic the look of freshly fallen snow. Its lush, snowy appearance creates a stunning winter-inspired centerpiece for your holiday décor.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/royal-fir-artificial-christmas-tree\" title=\"Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eRoyal Fir\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e offers a traditional silhouette and welcoming presence, creating a timeless holiday centerpiece that is perfect for cherished traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable seasonal moments. The Royal Fir is perfect for those seeking a full, realistic Christmas tree with the added convenience of multimode lighting.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThe \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/yorkshire-fir-artificial-christmas-tree\" title=\"Yorkshire Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYorkshire Fir\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e is a favorite for those seeking both style and simplicity—and was proudly featured as the Top Budget Tree for 2025. Perfect as a timeless centerpiece, the Yorkshire Fir invites joy, celebration, and ease all season long.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eHow do you store a full Christmas tree?\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eUsing an after-season storage bag helps preserve the full shape and longevity of your artificial Christmas tree. Each Carol's Christmas Conifers tree includes complimentary shaping gloves and a storage bag designed to protect the branches and lights between seasons.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhether you’re decorating a spacious living room or creating a traditional holiday centerpiece, full artificial Christmas trees offer a timeless and elegant look. Explore our collection to find a tree that brings warmth, fullness, and lasting beauty to your home year after year.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-unlit","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642895167552,"sku":"PF-T8-U","price":219.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-11_5e399119-a4fe-4d26-8c77-bde58886c97f.jpg?v=1718158952"},{"product_id":"6-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"6' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 350 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642895921216,"sku":"PF-T6-L","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fbb2edf4-c5c9-4ad1-b201-ca0c1c1c4b0e.jpg?v=1714675465"},{"product_id":"7-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"7' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":41965569769672,"sku":"PF-T7-L","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fa622227-8cc4-441c-b46e-a6f7c09044bd.jpg?v=1714675463"},{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 550 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642896379968,"sku":"PF-T8-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_5024a958-646c-4413-8cbb-72107e8ba72d.jpg?v=1714675448"},{"product_id":"9-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"9' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 650 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642896576576,"sku":"PF-T9-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_4d66d600-8734-493e-9b99-6279743376a5.jpg?v=1714675446"},{"product_id":"10-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"10' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003