":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642897068096,"sku":"QF-T6.5-L","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_7831fc2c-0c60-49cb-9368-a7127a8aaa1c.jpg?v=1722012623"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642897461312,"sku":"QF-T7.5-U","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-5.jpg?v=1718158615"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 800 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642897657920,"sku":"QF-T7.5-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_27cc53c6-965e-42b2-aec7-3712ea7dcff9.jpg?v=1722012616"},{"product_id":"9-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"9' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 1100 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642898804800,"sku":"QF-T9-L","price":999.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_570c2957-702c-4393-95f3-99e0455c528e.jpg?v=1722012619"},{"product_id":"10-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"10' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 1300 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642900377664,"sku":"QF-T10-L","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_8290f7cc-4dda-4d7d-bfbf-bc58b0b18dbc.jpg?v=1722012625"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-king-flock-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642903261248,"sku":"KF-T6.5-U","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-tree_ce57b97c-8ed9-4b63-ad5f-a680729c1e8c.jpg?v=1718158578"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-king-flock-tree-led","title":"6.5' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 600 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642903457856,"sku":"KF-T6.5-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlock_ebe75cbb-ea05-4fc5-9bd7-ab8b65a4fa99.jpg?v=1714673358"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-flock-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642904178752,"sku":"KF-T7.5-U","price":349.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/produ